DOCUMENTATION:
    PURPOSE: Toy WGTMAP exercising SNMAGSHIFT (HOSTLIB_MSKOPT bit 4)
    USAGE_KEY: HOSTLIB_WGTMAP_FILE
    USAGE_CODE: snlc_sim.exe
    NOTES:
        SNMAGSHIFT ramps linearly with LOGMASS, +0.05 at 8.0 to -0.05 at
        12.0 — a mass step smeared into a ramp so the interpolation is
        exercised too. WGT is constant, so host selection is unchanged
        from a run without this map and only the magnitude shift differs.
DOCUMENTATION_END:

VARNAMES_WGTMAP: LOGMASS WGT SNMAGSHIFT
WGT:   8.000   1.0000  +0.0500
WGT:   8.500   1.0000  +0.0375
WGT:   9.000   1.0000  +0.0250
WGT:   9.500   1.0000  +0.0125
WGT:  10.000   1.0000  +0.0000
WGT:  10.500   1.0000  -0.0125
WGT:  11.000   1.0000  -0.0250
WGT:  11.500   1.0000  -0.0375
WGT:  12.000   1.0000  -0.0500
